      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Step 1  In a big pot, place water and bring it to a boil. Water should
    be enough to cover the meat. Place pig\u2019s ears and pork jowl (or pork belly)
    then simmer for 40 minutes to 1 hour (or until tender). Season with salt and
    pepper.\n\nStep 2 Remove the boiled ingredients from the pot then drain excess
    water.\n\nStep 3 In a wide pan, heat the oil. Add the onions and cook until translucent.\n\nStep
    4 Add the ginger, garlic and green finger chilies and saute.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
